  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity Assessment (ISK) NIMD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutional Capacity Assessment (ISK) NIMD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma de interna kontrollrutinerna hos Netherlands Institute for Multiparty Democracy (NIMD) Colombia. Sida avser att ing&#xe5; avtal med organisationen f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja kvinnors och ungdomars representation i det colombianska politiska systemet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims at assessing the internal control arrangements of the Netherlands Institute for Multiparty Democracy -NIMD- Colombia as Sida intends to enter into an agreement with this organization to foster a better representation of women and young people in the Colombian political system.</narrative>
  </description>
